ine-zelenskyy-says-security-deal-could-go-to-referendum/a-79947535?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US has broached the idea of Kyiv giving up the Donbas region in exchange for NATO membership, the Ukrainian president said.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>New facilities in Laos and Cambodia: Is China expanding its military presence in Southeast Asia?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:43fd93b14250424b37045c07cdaf509e91d3e094a5eb6c6142802e04040df73d</id><updated>2026-11-15T15:43:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T11:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/new-facilities-in-laos-and-cambodia-is-china-expanding-its-military-presence-in-southeast-asia/a-79944798--c731be0f2b99.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/new-facilities-in-laos-and-cambodia-is-china-expanding-its-military-presence-in-southeast-asia/a-79944798?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">China has been growing its economic relationships in Southeast Asia. Now new military facilities in Laos and Cambodia are causing smaller countries to worry China's military networks are also expanding.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Wolf Biermann at 90: The singer who defied East Germany</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a6dc4b8ef65d24d133d1f43867fa82e8cf64f7bf8c0e76f3769e3a50af0846c</id><updated>2026-11-15T15:43:58Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wolf-biermann-at-90-the-singer-who-defied-east-germany/a-79915297--17726feda083.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wolf-biermann-at-90-the-singer-who-defied-east-germany/a-79915297?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">His life is a reflection of contemporary German history, which Biermann has addressed via his songs and sharp wit. Turning 90, he’s as feisty as ever.</summary><category term="Culture" 